{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Join the Discord server to participate in future playtests. Link found in the social media section.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Delve is a VR dungeon crawler built around physics-based combat. Team up with up to two other players in online co-op or go into the dungeons solo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the weight of your weapon as you dismember your enemies and defend against their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/4ac10e8dbd918beb25560202e6f52be6.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/4ac10e8dbd918beb25560202e6f52be6.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/4ac10e8dbd918beb25560202e6f52be6.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed swords &amp; axes, bows, shields, and powerful spells as you fight, loot, and explore your way towards the final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/2173fc110ae1625ecd5153858437f264.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/2173fc110ae1625ecd5153858437f264.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/2173fc110ae1625ecd5153858437f264.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/5a8465c20e8250538c5f54232632dc4a.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/5a8465c20e8250538c5f54232632dc4a.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/5a8465c20e8250538c5f54232632dc4a.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/d51ff02c0ccf4a3810a52cbcd8ef8341.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/d51ff02c0ccf4a3810a52cbcd8ef8341.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/d51ff02c0ccf4a3810a52cbcd8ef8341.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a party to explore the dungeons  or beat the dungeon as a solo adventurer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/e047acec1e0f5c3897c5b5fc0c44f333.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/e047acec1e0f5c3897c5b5fc0c44f333.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/e047acec1e0f5c3897c5b5fc0c44f333.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dungeon runs, relax in the social hub, interact with other players, and use the materials you've gathered to craft new weapons and armor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/39a9c6936c75933def413474cfaf814e.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/39a9c6936c75933def413474cfaf814e.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/39a9c6936c75933def413474cfaf814e.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847110?t=1774369375","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847110?t=1774369375","capsule_image":"https://shared.