ers in online co-op or go into the dungeons solo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the weight of your weapon as you dismember your enemies and defend against their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/02043159ace9421202adab44f9102c76.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/4ac10e8dbd918beb25560202e6f52be6.poster.avif?t=1774369375\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/4ac10e8dbd918beb25560202e6f52be6.webm?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extras/4ac10e8dbd918beb25560202e6f52be6.mp4?t=1774369375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of one-handed and two-handed swords &amp; axes, bows, shields, and powerful spells as you fight, loot, and explore your way towards the final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847110/extra